# JUCE 9.0.1 on Linux retains FreeType/fontconfig fallback state beyond
# shutdownJuce_GUI(). The affected path begins in the JUCE implementation below,
# not Shuba source: juce::FreeTypeTypeface::fromPattern().
#
# Scope: Linux ASAN CTest runs only. The rule keeps detect_leaks=1 active and
# excludes only reports whose stack includes this exact JUCE fallback function.
# The ASAN-only negative-control executable proves unrelated project leaks still
# fail. Reassess and remove this rule on a JUCE upgrade, font-backend change,
# upstream cleanup, or any new reported allocation path.
leak:juce::FreeTypeTypeface::fromPattern
